# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
# Auto-regenerated by `flutter gen-l10n` (runs on every pub get/build since
# pubspec.yaml sets flutter.generate: true) -- lib/l10n/app_*.arb is the
# source of truth, never hand-edit these.
lib/l10n/generated/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release
